    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Modal auxiliary verbs are strictly followed by the base form (V1) of the main verb.",
        "'Need' and 'dare' act as modal auxiliaries primarily in negative and interrogative sentences.",
        "'Used to' denotes a past habit and is followed by V1 when used as a modal auxiliary."
